---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../config";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" titleZh="关于">
  <article class="page prose">
    <div class="en-text">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p>Hello, I'm {SITE.author}.</p>
      <p>
        I work on LLMs and agent training, exploring how models can learn to
        reason, use tools, and handle complex tasks. I studied Artificial
        Intelligence and Data Science at the University of Science and
        Technology of China and am currently working as an algorithm engineer in
        Shanghai.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of work, I spend a lot of time with games, music, films, and
        anime. I enjoy singing, working out, cycling, taking long walks without a
        destination, and occasionally attempting my dream of playing and singing
        with a stringless guitar.
      </p>
      <p>
        I have always liked keeping notes. Writing helps me make sense of
        technical problems, intense emotions, and the ordinary experiences that
        would otherwise disappear too quickly.
      </p>
      <p>
        I value sincerity, empathy, independent thinking, and direct
        communication. I believe life is more about experiencing the journey
        than collecting conclusions.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is where I document both sides of my life: what I am building
        and learning, and what I find worth remembering along the way. You can
        find my research on <a href={SITE.scholar}>Google Scholar</a>, my projects
        on <a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a>, and more of my life on
        <a href={SITE.xiaohongshu}>Xiaohongshu</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="zh-text">
      <h1>关于</h1>
      <p>你好，我是 {SITE.author}。</p>
      <p>
        我从事大语言模型与智能体训练相关工作，关注模型如何学习推理、使用工具并完成复杂任务。我毕业于中国科学技术大学人工智能与数据科学专业，目前在上海担任算法工程师。
      </p>
      <p>
        工作之外，我会把很多时间留给游戏、音乐、电影和动漫。我喜欢唱歌、健身、骑行和漫无目的地散步，也会偶尔用无弦吉他继续尝试自己的弹唱梦想。
      </p>
      <p>
        我一直喜欢记录。写作帮助我理解技术问题、浓烈的情绪，以及那些稍纵即逝的日常体验。
      </p>
      <p>
        我重视真诚、共情、独立思考和直接沟通。我相信人生更重要的是体验过程，而不是收集结论。
      </p>
      <p>
        这个网站记录着我生活的两面：正在构建和学习的事物，以及一路上值得被记住的东西。你可以在 <a href={SITE.scholar}>谷歌学术</a>查看我的研究，在 <a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a> 查看我的项目，也可以在<a href={SITE.xiaohongshu}>小红书</a>看到更多生活。
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
